      "title": "On Campus Ave Maria University Student Worker",
      "description": "Posted: 2022-01-06\n\nLocation: AVE MARIA\n\nThis requisition is part of the hiring process for Ave Maria University students who have already been offered a position. It is used to collect the information needed by the Human Resources Department to complete your employment and onboarding. When you click the Apply button, uploading a cover letter is optional . If you do not wish to upload one, simply click Next at the bottom of the screen to continue.",
